### Recorrer de arriba a abajo (extensión REST Client de VS Code
### o el cliente HTTP de IntelliJ). En Postman, crear una request por bloque.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
# Después del primer POST, copiar aquí el id que devolvió
@taskId = 1
# Después del login, pegar aquí el accessToken (sin "Bearer")
@token = pega-aqui-el-token

### ---------- Auth (paso 7) ----------

### Tareas SIN token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### Registro -> 201 (sin el hash)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "supersecreta"
}

### Registro repetido -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "supersecreta"
}

### Login con contraseña incorrecta -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "incorrecta"
}

### Login correcto -> 200 { accessToken }
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "supersecreta"
}

### Usuario actual -> 200 { id, email }
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Tasks (requieren token) ----------

### Health check -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Listar tareas -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST válido -> 201 (fijarse que trim() quita los espacios)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   Estudiar para el parcial   ",
  "description": "Repasar capas y validación"
}

### POST con title vacío -> 400 con details
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### POST con title de solo espacios -> 400 (gracias a trim)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "    "
}

### Obtener una tarea -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PATCH { done: true } -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### PATCH vacío -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### DELETE -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DELETE otra vez -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET de la tarea borrada -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Id que no es número -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ruta inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/no-existe
